<h2>=F0=9F=96=B1=EF=B8=8F How to make it work when shared</h2>
<h3>Option 1 =E2=80=94 Simplest: they download &amp; open it</h3>
<p>Share the OneDrive link as normal. When your colleague clicks it, they h=
it <strong>Download</strong>, then open the <code>.html</code> file =E2=86=
=92 it launches in their browser and works perfectly.
