eter.</p>
<h3>Option 2 =E2=80=94 Best "just click and play": host it properly</h3>
<p>For a real clickable link where it <em>runs instantly</em> in the browse=
r, you want static web hosting instead of OneDrive:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> (free) =E2=80=94 create a repo, drop the =
file in, enable Pages =E2=86=92 you get a live URL anyone can click.</li>
<li><strong>Azure Static Web Apps / Blob static site</strong> =E2=80=94 rig=
ht up your alley given your Azure work; upload the file, share the URL.</li=
>
<li><strong>Netlify / Cloudflare Pages</strong> =E2=80=94 literally drag-an=
d-drop the file onto their site, get an instant public link.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Option 3 =E2=80=94 Keep it internal: embed it in SharePoint/Teams</h3>
<p>Since you're already in the Brennan tenant, you could pop it on a <stron=
g>SharePoint page</strong> using the <em>Embed</em> web part, or pin it as =
